			<name>Acid Bomb*</name>
			<description>When the alchemist creates a bomb, he can choose to have it inflict acid damage. Creatures that take a direct hit from an acid bomb take an additional 1d6 points of acid damage 1 round later.</description>
			<type>ALCHEMISTCLASSFEATURES.SPECIALATTACK.ALCHEMISTDISCOVERY.ALCHEMISTBOMBMODIFIER</type>
